            "locator": "section/Security risks",
            "text": "Security risks (and the need to mitigate them) can occur at any point in the development lifecycle: Design – ensure that the design doesn't naturally allow attackers to easily gain unauthorized access to the workload, its data, or other business assets in the organization."
