            "id": "p1",
            "locator": "Red Hat Secure Development Lifecycle section",
            "text": "Red Hat maintains a software development lifecycle (SDLC) process that addresses risk assessment, vulnerability assessment, and security testing protocols of Red Hat software. Red Hat's SDLC process follows the \nNIST SP 800-218 Secure Software Development Framework\n, conducting security reviews related to secure architecture, secure pipeline, threat modeling, Static and Dynamic Application Security Testing, antimalware scanning,  penetration testing, and incident"
          }
        ],
